["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/sha384", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "SHA-2 with a digest length of 384, as defined in [RFC 6234](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc6234/).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
